\f1\fs22 With Hayley at her side, Sarah walked through the double doors at heavily pregnant pace, past the Sages   occupying the near end of the conference table and immediately made for the passage to the bathrooms. Hayley followed and stood at the sinks while Sarah took to the next-to-last cubicle.\
